<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?>
<Flow xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <apiVersion>67.0</apiVersion>
    <areMetricsLoggedToDataCloud>false</areMetricsLoggedToDataCloud>
    <decisions>
        <name>Is_Parent_Inspection_Completed</name>
        <label>Parent Inspection Completed?</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Keep Inspection Status</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Parent_Inspection_Completed</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference
        >$Record.InspectionResult__r.Inspection__r.Status__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>점검완료</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference
        >Update_Parent_Inspection_To_Correcting</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Move Inspection to 시정중</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description
  >26-10-18 시정조치 생성 후 부모 점검이 점검완료면 시정중으로 전환. 그 외 상태는 그대로(전이 검증은 점검 트리거) by Kai</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <interviewLabel
  >[시정조치] After Trigger 점검 시정중 전환 {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>[시정조치] After Trigger 점검 시정중 전환</label>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>BuilderType</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>CanvasMode</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>AUTO_LAYOUT_CANVAS</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>OriginBuilderType</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processType>AutoLaunchedFlow</processType>
    <recordUpdates>
        <description
    >같은 점검의 시정조치가 여러 건이어도 「점검완료」인 점검만 대상이라 두 번째부터는 조건에 걸리지 않는다</description>
        <name>Update_Parent_Inspection_To_Correcting</name>
        <label>Set Parent Inspection Status to 시정중</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>Id</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference
        >$Record.InspectionResult__r.Inspection__c</elementReference>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <filters>
            <field>Status__c</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <stringValue>점검완료</stringValue>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <inputAssignments>
            <field>Status__c</field>
            <value>
                <stringValue>시정중</stringValue>
            </value>
        </inputAssignments>
        <object>Inspection__c</object>
    </recordUpdates>
    <start>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Is_Parent_Inspection_Completed</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <object>CorrectiveAction__c</object>
        <recordTriggerType>Create</recordTriggerType>
        <triggerType>RecordAfterSave</triggerType>
    </start>
    <status>Active</status>
</Flow>
